gUr(){return"Ba\u011fla"},
gUG(){return"Bir Meta geli\u015ftirici hesab\u0131na (\xfccretsiz) ve WhatsApp uygulamas\u0131nda KULLANILMAYAN bir telefon numaras\u0131na ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z var.\n1. developers.facebook.com \u2192 My Apps \u2192 Create app \u2192 \"Connect with customers through WhatsApp\" ve klini\u011fin i\u015fletme portf\xf6y\xfcn\xfc se\xe7in.\n2. WhatsApp \u2192 API Setup \u2192 Add phone number: klini\u011fin numaras\u0131n\u0131 girin ve SMS ile do\u011frulay\u0131n. Orada g\xf6sterilen Phone number ID ve WhatsApp Business Account ID'yi kopyalay\u0131n.\n3. App settings \u2192 Basic: App ID ve App secret'\u0131 kopyalay\u0131n. Gizlilik politikas\u0131 ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 olarak https://iqclinics.net/privacy/ ekleyin ve uygulamay\u0131 Live yap\u0131n.\n4. business.facebook.com \u2192 Settings \u2192 Users \u2192 System users \u2192 Add (Admin). Ona uygulamay\u0131 ve WhatsApp hesab\u0131n\u0131 verin (tam kontrol), sonra Generate token: s\xfcresiz, whatsapp_business_messaging ve whatsapp_business_management ile. Belirteci kopyalay\u0131n.\n5. \u0130\u015fletme ayarlar\u0131 \u2192 Billing: WhatsApp i\xe7in bir \xf6deme kart\u0131 ekleyin.\nSonra hepsini a\u015fa\u011f\u0131ya yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n."},
